  "term": "agreement",
  "definition": "Agreement is a historical term for concord or harmony, and also for similarity or sameness, including a meaningful connection between ideas. In logic and older theories of knowledge, it can also mean the consistency of judgments or the way ideas are seen as connected, alike, coexisting, or matching real existence.",
